      "en": "Go therefore now, and work; for no straw shall be given to you; yet you shall deliver the same number of bricks!”",
      "ko": "이제 가서 일하라 짚은 너희에게 주지 않을찌라도 너희가 벽돌은 여수히 바칠찌니라",
      "source_text_hash": "572e788884cd9bdb20ea18623fec22e9270f29e2cbbfd0b567192620e179b91d",
      "translation_text_hash": "12108611358bc18771eae2e18e2d46dff5d2429bc472cc4d4e9a6db7e5339af6",
