      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "EXO",
          "chapter": 5,
          "verse": 19
        }
      ],
      "en": "The officers of the children of Israel saw that they were in trouble when it was said, “You shall not diminish anything from your daily quota of bricks!”",
      "ko": "이스라엘 자손의 패장들이 너희의 매일 만드는 벽돌을 조금도 감하지 못하리라 함을 듣고 화가 몸에 미친줄 알고",
      "source_text_hash": "2a457acff4b18c09730aa94107172affe4116cb4a1c6228b6b2419e2ae61c052",
      "translation_text_hash": "d6b66279315384f459458e07ffb6ac2e540e0699e985d81e17cf4d94bd5d4a55",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
