      "en": "They met Moses and Aaron, who stood along the way, as they came out from Pharaoh.",
      "ko": "그들이 바로를 떠나 나올 때에 모세와 아론이 길에 선것을 만나",
      "source_text_hash": "2c70ee5c885687295195c37f9fd5e1bee0482a2331ceebc16463439abf8bbcf8",
      "translation_text_hash": "8e09aca081c36a2f32f5a4a07a19be759676613785db5c4f51dad245d28533b5",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
